# Marrow Key Museum (CIPlay marrow_key_museum): the plan Relic of the Seventh Tide's first island, quest "Someone Got
# Here First". The terrace (3 m) round 0 0 r 20; the museum x -7.5..7.5 z -6..3 (portico z -9..-6, double door at
# x -1.5..1.5); the desk 6.1 -5.1, the safe 6.7 -3.4, its keypad 6.7 -2; the landing path up x 0 from z -76.
# 10-25 deep pass: Signal Hill (40 38, 24 m; trail foot 23.7 21.7) and the curator's mast (key in its box), the
# Syndicate launch at 60 -30 (orders), then back to the safe (code + key).
island Marrow Key Museum
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Someone Got Here First
wait 3
expect hidden ambushzone
walk 0 -26 to 0 -18 to 0 -12 h=3
zone museum_steps
expect step 1
walk 0 -10 to 0 -7.5 to 0 -4 to 3 -3 h=3
read Curator's report
expect step 2
read Exhibit 7 card
expect step 3
open Curator's safe
expect message keypad
code safekeypad 1111 wrong
code safekeypad 9427
open Curator's safe
expect story journal 0
expect message keyhole
zone signalfoot
expect step 4
zone signaltop
expect step 5
read Curator Ambrose Vell
expect step 6
open Curator's signal box
wait 3
expect story safekey 1
expect step 7
zone launch
read Syndicate orders
expect step 8
open Curator's safe
expect story journal 1
expect step 10
expect shown ambushzone
zone ambush
wait 2
kill Hyena
expect done
